    "innovation": "This study provides a comprehensive vulnerability assessment for the bara\u00fana tree (*Schinopsis brasiliensis*) by integrating the combined effects of climate change, land-cover change, and biological invasion into ecological niche models to project its future distribution in the Brazilian Caatinga.",
